# A 4 ppqn clock on J3 (Settings default): 100 ms pulses = 150 BPM.
# B2 turns blue when locked and J8 follows the clock: one trigger a pulse
# (sixteenths, all open). J4 resets. Clock gone -> grey, free-running again.
